NOTE: 
stringstream is a stream class that lets you treat a string like input/output (cin / cout) 
It allows you to read data from a string the same way you read from cin. 
A string may contain numbers + characters 
We want to extract numbers easily 
stringstream automatically converts string → int 
BASIC SYNTAX: 
gstream ss(string_name); 
ss >> variable;   //LIKE cin>>variable; 
SIMPLE EXAMPLE: 
